You are an expert Fullstack Developer and UI/UX Designer.

Project Goal:
Build a modern, clean, bilingual (FR/EN) personal portfolio website for a Fullstack Developer named:
TOLOTRA NOMENJANAHARY RANDRIANANTENAINA.

Design System:
- Primary color: Midnight Blue
- Secondary color: Beige
- Accent colors: Brown and Garnet (Deep Red)
- Style: Modern, minimalist, elegant, tech-oriented
- Rounded cards, soft shadows, smooth animations
- Use modern typography and good contrast

Core Requirements:
- Bilingual website with language switcher (FR / EN)
- All text content must exist in both French and English
- Fully responsive (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- SEO friendly
- Fast loading
- Accessible

Tech Stack:
- React 18.3.1
- TypeScript 5.5.3
- Vite 5.4.2
- Tailwind CSS 3.4.1
- Lucide React (icons)
- Component-based architecture

Project Structure:
- src/
  - components/
    - Header.tsx
    - Hero.tsx
    - About.tsx
    - Skills.tsx
    - Experience.tsx
    - Projects.tsx
    - Education.tsx
    - Certifications.tsx
    - Contact.tsx
  - contexts/
    - LanguageContext.tsx (contains all translations)
  - App.tsx
  - main.tsx
  - index.css

Internationalization:
- All translations are stored in LanguageContext.tsx
- Use useLanguage() hook with t() function to access translations
- Translation keys follow dot notation: 'section.subsection.key'
- No hardcoded strings in components
- Language state managed via React Context API

